{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/353928-how-to-justify-leaked-information-not-spreading-like-fire","id":353928,"title":"How to Justify Leaked information not spreading like fire.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-29T11:36:01-08:00","id":353928,"title":"How to Justify Leaked information not spreading like fire.","content":"A common conceit across NWOD and CWOD both is that members of one splat know virtualy nothing about others.<br /> <br /> and members of a pack, coterie, throng, whatever have to work hard to learn anything<br /> <br /> Ideas why they wouldnt share<br /> <br /> Project Twilight in particular would love to collect more info.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T05:50:53-08:00","id":354692,"title":"","content":"People do share this information though, which is represented by dots in &quot;Lore&quot; of various types.<br /> <br /> Discerning the truth from observations isn't easy. Unless someone told you, what is it you would have to SEE to know that Ventrue can only drink certain types of blood? If you thought that... how would you prove it?<br /> <br /> The supernaturals in the WoD are all experts at hiding their secret society from the public, and they reinforce it with supernatural powers and networks of influence and authority.<br /> <br /> Why wouldn't they share? A lot of reasons.<br /> <br /> 1) Tipping your hand. Trust is a two-way street.<br /> 2) Valuable knowledge. This info didn't come easily, why give it away freely?<br /> 3) Leverage. A secret isn't a secret once you share it.<br /> <br /> And many more. Consider a human with 4 or 5 dots in Vampire Lore. If he made that common knowledge (that he has it) to every random Jack on the street, he would be dead inside of a week.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, keep in mind that from the outside looking in, some of these creatures can never hope to understand each other. How could Vampires possibly understand the Garou... when most of them don't even know the spirit world exists. How can Garou understand Mages... when a seemingly normal computer hacker, car mechanic, exotic dancer, and salt-of-the-earth farmer (walk into a bar) all seem to work together and have no discernable pattern to their practices.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":2211,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","user":"SixFootChicken","date":". 12-30-2014, 08:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","name":"SixFootChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"559"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T13:40:37-08:00","id":356011,"title":"","content":"Also, misinformation. Everyone knows that a unibrow is a common sign of a werewolf, and that no vampire can stand the sight of a holy symbol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2214-traveller","name":"Traveller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2214_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T15:26:42-08:00","id":356054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Traveller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/353928-how-to-justify-leaked-information-not-spreading-like-fire?p=356011#post356011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, misinformation. Everyone knows that a unibrow is a common sign of a werewolf, and that no vampire can stand the sight of a holy symbol.</div> </div> </div> </div>I suspect that most people outside of Europe tend to regard unibrows either neutrally or as a sign of personal neglect above being the sign of the werewolf, by a rather wide and overwhelming margin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 12-31-2014, 07:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}